# Multi-model provider abstraction (spec 2026-05-27-benchmark-multi-model-provider-design).
# provider-factory.ts, openai.ts, anthropic.ts already live here; committing the full
# providers/ directory so new provider classes land in version control.
!benchmarks/longmemeval/providers/
